msgstr "Hay facturas rectificativas contabilizadas que afectan a la posición %(position)s; revisa la medición acumulada antes de exportar."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/account_move.py:22
msgid "Cannot cancel the advance invoice while its advance is applied on active certifications."
msgstr "No se puede cancelar la factura del anticipo mientras esté aplicado en certificaciones activas."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/account_move.py:180
msgid "The generated credit note does not fully reverse the construction invoice %s. The operation was rolled back."
msgstr "La factura rectificativa generada no revierte por completo la factura de obra %s. Se ha revertido la operación."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/account_move.py:158
msgid "Invoice %(invoice)s has partial credit notes. Complete the remaining refund from Accounting before cancelling the certification or advance. Automatic cancellation is blocked to prevent an unreversed balance."
msgstr "La factura %(invoice)s tiene rectificaciones parciales. Completa la rectificación pendiente desde Contabilidad antes de cancelar la certificación o el anticipo. Se bloquea la cancelación automática para evitar un saldo sin revertir."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/account_move.py:409
msgid "Cannot fully refund advance %s while it is still applied on active certifications."
msgstr "No se puede rectificar por completo el anticipo %s mientras esté aplicado en certificaciones activas."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:929
msgid "Retention to release (%(release)s) exceeds this period's retention (%(available)s). Use a retention liquidation to pay back retention that was already invoiced."
msgstr "La retención que se va a liberar (%(release)s) supera la retención de este periodo (%(available)s). Usa una liquidación para devolver retenciones ya facturadas."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:414
msgid "Save the certification's work, retentions and advances before approving or invoicing it."
msgstr "Guarda las mediciones, retenciones y anticipos de la certificación antes de aprobarla o facturarla."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:735
msgid "The date cannot be earlier than an approved or invoiced certification of the same sales order."
msgstr "La fecha no puede ser anterior a una certificación aprobada o facturada del mismo pedido."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:327
msgid "The certification's linked invoice cannot be replaced or cleared."
msgstr "No se puede sustituir ni eliminar la factura vinculada a la certificación."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:344
msgid "The credit-note link cannot be cleared while the invoice remains reversed."
msgstr "No se puede eliminar el vínculo con la factura rectificativa mientras la factura siga revertida."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:350
msgid "The reversal must be a posted credit note of this certification's invoice."
msgstr "La reversión debe ser una factura rectificativa contabilizada de la factura de esta certificación."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:858
msgid "Could not reduce the applied advance by the requested amount."
msgstr "No se ha podido reducir el anticipo aplicado por el importe solicitado."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:868
msgid "Cannot reopen the certification: advance %s is cancelled."
msgstr "No se puede reabrir la certificación: el anticipo %s está cancelado."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:874
msgid "Cannot reopen the certification: advance %(advance)s only has %(free)s pending."
msgstr "No se puede reabrir la certificación: el anticipo %(advance)s solo tiene %(free)s pendiente."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:1002
msgid "Applied advances (%(current)s) exceed the net amount (%(target)s). Reduce the lines on the Advances tab."
msgstr "Los anticipos aplicados (%(current)s) superan el importe neto (%(target)s). Reduce las líneas de la pestaña Anticipos."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:1063
msgid "Post the invoice of advance %s before deducting it, including when the advance has no taxes."
msgstr "Contabiliza la factura del anticipo %s antes de deducirlo, aunque el anticipo no tenga impuestos."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:1105
msgid "Tax %s forces a tax-included price and cannot be mixed or used as a fixed amount on a certification invoice."
msgstr "El impuesto %s exige precio con impuestos incluidos y no se puede mezclar ni usar como importe fijo en una factura de certificación."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:373
msgid "The origin invoice has not been fully reversed. A partial credit note does not cancel the certification."
msgstr "La factura a origen no se ha revertido por completo. Una factura rectificativa parcial no cancela la certificación."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification.py:380
msgid "A cancelled posted invoice cannot be reopened unless its credit note has itself been reversed."
msgstr "Una factura contabilizada y cancelada solo puede reabrirse si se ha revertido su rectificativa."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/res_company.py:75
msgid "Account %s has to be reconcilable so the advance or the retention can be matched. Mark it as reconcilable on the account, then invoice again."
msgstr "La cuenta %s debe permitir conciliación para conciliar el anticipo o la retención. Márcala como conciliable y vuelve a facturar."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: code:addons/tl_construction_certification/models/construction_certification_line.py:714
