msgid "Certified origin after posted credit notes. The billed origin above does not move."
msgstr "Importe certificado a origen después de las rectificativas contabilizadas. El origen facturado anterior no cambia."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tl_construction_certification.field_construction_certification__amount_previously_invoiced
msgid "Amount to invoice of earlier approved or invoiced certifications. Drafts and measured certifications are not included."
msgstr "Importe a facturar de las certificaciones anteriores aprobadas o facturadas. No incluye borradores ni certificaciones medidas."

#. module: tl_construction_certification
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tl_construction_certification.field_construction_certification__retention_percent
